---
title: "Turn organization SSO off"
icon: arrow-up-right
description: "Turn organization SSO off: disableOrganizationSso in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`POST /v1/auth/organizations/{orgId}/sso/disable`

Deletes the provider connection, releases the SSO requirement once the connection is gone, then unbinds the chosen domains. Retry with the same Idempotency-Key to resume or await the same run.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.auth.disableOrganizationSso(input: DisableOrganizationSsoInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<DisableOrganizationSsoOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.auth.disable_organization_sso(input: DisableOrganizationSsoInput) -> models.OrganizationSsoConfiguration
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.disable_organization_sso(idempotency_key: String, org_id: String, body: &types::DisableOrganizationSsoRequest).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::OrganizationSsoConfiguration>, Error<DisableOrganizationSsoError>>
```
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<RequestExample>
```typescript TypeScript
import { Photon } from "@photon-ai/api";

const photon = new Photon({
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.PHOTON_API_TOKEN}` },
});
const result = await photon.auth.disableOrganizationSso({
  path: {
    orgId: "orgId",
  },
  headers: {
    idempotencyKey: "idempotencyKey",
  },
  body: {
    expectedVersion: "expectedVersion",
  },
});
```

```python Python
import os

from photon_api import Photon
from photon_api.rpc_generated import DisableOrganizationSsoInput

photon = Photon(headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {os.environ['PHOTON_API_TOKEN']}"})
result = photon.auth.disable_organization_sso(
    DisableOrganizationSsoInput.model_validate({
        "path": {
            "orgId": "orgId",
        },
        "headers": {
            "Idempotency-Key": "idempotencyKey",
        },
        "body": {
            "expectedVersion": "expectedVersion",
        },
    })
)
```

```rust Rust
use photon_ai_api::{Credential, PhotonClientBuilder, SecretString};

let token = std::env::var("PHOTON_API_TOKEN")?;
let client = PhotonClientBuilder::new()
    .credential("accountServiceKey", Credential::Bearer(SecretString::from(token)))
    .build()?;
let result = client
    .disable_organization_sso(
        "idempotencyKey".to_owned(),
        "orgId".to_owned(),
        &serde_json::from_value(serde_json::json!({
            "expectedVersion": "expectedVersion",
        }))?,
    )
    .await
    .map_err(|error| format!("{error:?}"))?
    .into_inner();
```

</RequestExample>

